#   postpro/L2/paraview/driven/driven.pvd vis/L2_scattered.vtu \
#   --direction 1 0 0 --polarization 0 0 1 --frequency 1.19e9
# ```
#
# and open `vis/L2_scattered.vtu` (or the `.pvd`) in ParaView, coloring by
# `E_scat_mag` with a logarithmic scale.
